Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared alphabet as empty text.
Keep a shared required as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared seen as 0.
Keep a shared enough as 0.
For every spot from 0 to 25.
Place 0 into required.

To require.
Set seen to 0.
For every spot from 0 to 25.
Set seen to 0.
The symbol is character spot of alphabet.
For every place from 0 to the last position of current, if character place of current is symbol, add 1 to seen.
If seen is more than item spot of required, set item spot of required to seen.

To check.
Set enough to 1.
For every spot from 0 to 25.
Set seen to 0.
The symbol is character spot of alphabet.
For every place from 0 to the last position of current, if character place of current is symbol, add 1 to seen.
If seen is less than item spot of required, set enough to 0.

The words is a list of "amazon", "apple", "facebook", "google", and "leetcode".
The demands is a list of "e" and "o".
Place "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" into alphabet.
For each demand in demands.
Set current to demand.
Require.

For each word in words.
Set current to word.
Check.
If enough is 1, report word.
